# Preserve the project's existing line endings byte-for-byte.
#
# 编译.bat and 恢复网络.bat are intentionally GBK-encoded (they run `chcp 936`),
# and SkyGuardGUI.cs uses CRLF while most .txt files use LF. Letting Git apply
# EOL normalisation or encoding guessing would rewrite these files, so every
# type tracked here is marked as not-text.
#
# Note: `-text` only disables EOL conversion; diffs are still rendered.

*.cs        -text
*.bat       -text
*.ps1       -text
*.txt       -text
*.md        -text
*.json      -text
*.manifest  -text
.gitignore  -text
.gitattributes -text
